---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Dream Guides — Understand Dream Meaning"
  description="Explore foundational guides on dream symbolism, intuition, and the language of your subconscious mind."
>
  <style>
    .guides-container {
      max-width: 900px;
      margin: 3rem auto;
      padding: 2rem;
      color: #e8e0ff;
      font-family: Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI",
        Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
    }

    .guides-title {
      font-size: 2.2rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: #e5ddff;
      text-align: center;
      margin-bottom: 1rem;
      letter-spacing: 0.02em;
    }

    .guides-subtitle {
      text-align: center;
      font-size: 1.15rem;
      color: #c4b5fd;
      margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }

    .guides-section {
      background: rgba(45, 21, 84, 0.35);
      border: 1px solid rgba(167, 139, 250, 0.3);
      border-radius: 14px;
      padding: 2rem;
      backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
      box-shadow: 0 0 22px rgba(76, 29, 149, 0.4);
      margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
    }

    .guides-section h2 {
      font-size: 1.6rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      color: #e5ddff;
      margin-bottom: 1rem;
      letter-spacing: 0.01em;
    }

    .guides-section p {
      color: #c4b5fd;
      font-size: 1.05rem;
      line-height: 1.6;
      margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    }

    /* ⭐ Make hyperlinks white */
    .guides-section a {
      color: #ffffff;
      text-decoration: none;
      font-weight: 500;
    }

    .guides-section a:hover {
      color: #e5ddff;
    }
  </style>

  <div class="guides-container">
    <h1 class="guides-title">Dream Guides</h1>

    <p class="guides-subtitle">
      Explore foundational guides on dream meanings, dream symbolism,  
      and the language of your subconscious mind.
    </p>

    <div class="guides-section">
      <h2>Foundational Guides</h2>
      <p>
        Let's begin with the essential principles that explain how dreams  
        communicate through symbols, emotional patterns, and intuitive  
        impressions.
      </p>
    <section class="header-block""font=SansSerif">
      <h1>Start Here</h1>
      <h3>Your First Step Into the World of Dream Meaning</h3>
      <p><strong>By The Guide</strong></p>
<p>
<p> Watch an introductory video...</p>
